% Index style for upmendex (makeindex syntax): a letter heading per group, the default "--" in page
% ranges (hyperref splits a range at "--"). \indexletter is defined in anemostatos-book.sty.
headings_flag 1
heading_prefix "\n\\indexletter{"
heading_suffix "}\n"
symhead_positive "Symbols"
numhead_positive "Numbers"
group_skip "\n\\indexspace\n"
